         "The Blaue Kuh butcher shop provides us with well-aged and tender meats. Gourmador delivers fresh vegetables and crisp fruits to us daily. Our cheese supplier is Beat Wampfler from Burgdorf. The Michel bakery supplies us with fresh bread. H&R provides us with coffee and dry goods. We deliberately avoid products requiring long transport routes and carefully select our suppliers.",
